<title>MALAYSIA: C.I. Holdings six-mth net off 2 pct.</title>
<headline>C.I. Holdings six-mth net off 2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    26.69	vs	  27.24</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)   46.5	 vs	  47.5</p>
<p>    Turnover	     187.58	vs	170.10</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	36.01	vs	 35.03</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	nil	 vs	  2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: C.I. Holdings Bhd's businesses include making and trading building and construction materials.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
